  "The UV Editor shows the UVs of the faces selected in the 3D Viewport. Press A over the 3D Viewport, or turn on UV Sync Selection.": { ca: "L'UV Editor mostra les UV de les cares seleccionades al 3D Viewport. Prem A sobre el 3D Viewport, o activa UV Sync Selection.", es: "El UV Editor muestra las UV de las caras seleccionadas en el 3D Viewport. Pulsa A sobre el 3D Viewport, o activa UV Sync Selection." },
